{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"title":"GrafluentCollections","modules":[{"name":"GrafluentCollections"}],"role":"collection","externalID":"GrafluentCollections","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every collection is a copy-on-write struct with the API shape of the standard library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"collections and Swift Collections. Where a structure is a tree or a graph, it also converts to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Grafluent type of that shape (","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Arborescence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"RootedTree","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so Grafluent’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"algorithms and drawings run over it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import GrafluentCollections"},{"text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be imported on its own.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import GrafluentCollections","","var scores: FenwickTree = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]","print(scores.prefixSum(through: 3))  \/\/ 9","print(scores.sum(in: 2 ..< 6))       \/\/ 19"]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent."}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/grafluentcollections"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GrafluentColle